<h3>11. Key Advantages</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Fast file discovery</strong> through metadata-based indexing.</=
li>
<li><strong>Centralized organization</strong> of cloud files.</li>
<li><strong>Secure authentication</strong> using JWT.</li>
<li><strong>Fine-grained access control</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>Version tracking</strong> for important files.</li>
